  "algorithm": "Validate full actual ordinary Ready before first mutation. Original whole-Ready one-write path retained. On proven no-effect owned admission refusal, sync first actually fitting prefix, apply genuine durable normal log only through original RawNode committed authority; fence all publication/compaction until actual RawNode offered pages/Advance reconcile physical and Raw applied. Old overwritten suffix never committed by replacement commit; predecessor commit<=min(C,F-1,oldLast). Recovery Reserve/Use backing, all quotas and uncertain-I/O fail-stop semantics retained.",
  "bounded_fallback_cost": "At most full classification plus incremental forward prefix classification (tests bound verifier work<=2N); actual ApplicationView/RootBounded per fitting prefix, prefix syncs and deferred compaction. Ordinary full-success path still applies offered entries without rereading durable log. Not a throughput or production-memory/SLO claim.",
  "receiving_boundary": "Configured voters remain placement only. Term-only sync on empty bound fixed-three state preserves inactive imports/protection; rejects active state, vote/commit/entries/snapshot. Normal Driver and bootstrap remain closed until actual snapshot activation; no replacement/quorum/retirement authorization.",
